<title>FRANCE: France sells 595 Mln Ecu OATs at auction.</title>
<headline>France sells 595 Mln Ecu OATs at auction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury sold the following government bonds (ECU OATs) at auction on Thursday.</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 25.APR.07	5.50	  595 MLN	    5.91</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS   LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 1.755 BLN/2.9		   NIL		  96.90</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 100						   27.FEB.97</p>
<p>* PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 42 21 54 52</p>
</text>
